  "tag": "anchor/predicates-1",
  "message": "anchor/predicates-1\n\nAnchor #1 of the Falden fixture pack. anchor/predicates-1.manifest records the sha256 of each file on the pack's verdict path, of the error taxonomy, of capture format 1 and of the release and recovery public keys, under a first line naming the build commit it was prepared from. anchor/predicates-1.sig is the release key's signature over the manifest, in namespace falden-fixture-anchor. anchor/predicates-1.tsr (DigiCert) and anchor/predicates-1.tsr2 (GlobalSign) are RFC 3161 timestamp tokens over that signature.\n-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgRFuwKScIGjjnlRZoARTo9qGtGn\nX1KZ5VSv1RbZDdZYQAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5\nAAAAQF9fsg5+dm2qdCre33UW9nlsQJFunXGEAqlSF4eaIh5OUx2Ek+NU05iXmFjFQC5sDN\nQ9TqoHIlg3Wrvk2kF1bgw=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----\n",
